# Fixed 2026-10-01, defect 138, lane emit: the RESULT's half of the rule.
# Symptom: `hero_args_raw(index: i64) -> cstr owned free`, where the library
# writes no mark on the result, stopped `check` with `internal error` at the
# library's line 116, exit 2.
# Cause: the result's comparison put the caret at the later declaration's
# name, the library's, as the parameters' did. The caret is now on this
# declaration's name.

extern "hero_os.h"
    function hero_args_raw(index: i64) -> cstr owned free  #~ contract_differs
    function free(p: ptr)

function main()
    print("hello")
